TITLE 1D transport with exchange
SOLUTION 0 Infilling
    pH 7.0
    Na 1.0
    Cl 1.0
SOLUTION 1-10 Initial
    pH 7.0
    Ca 1.0
    Cl 2.0
EXCHANGE_MASTER_SPECIES
X X-
EXCHANGE_SPECIES
X- = X-
    log_k 0.0
Na+ + X- = NaX
    log_k 0.0
Ca+2 + 2 X- = CaX2
    log_k 0.0
EXCHANGE 1-10
    X 0.001
TRANSPORT
    -cells 10
    -shifts 10
    -flow_direction forward
    -boundary_conditions flux flux
    -print_cells 4
    -print_frequency 10
END
